cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Standardizing a Bioinformatic Analysis Pipeline for Coral Metagenomics"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow for genome-resolved metagenomics of coral holobiont
  samples: it removes coral host and Symbiodiniaceae reads, assembles the
  remaining reads, recovers metagenome-assembled genomes (MAGs) with four
  binners plus the metaWRAP ensemble arm, and assesses their quality and
  taxonomy (CheckM, GTDB-Tk), followed by dRep dereplication.
authors:
